{"unit_id":"tonyzdev__dsh-session-messaging#feature-1","repo":"tonyzdev/dsh-session-messaging","commit":"69a97309ab3462249bdd02802d700ed93d08c55f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「查找会话」：按标题或会话 ID 搜索顶层会话，并返回状态、最近活动时间和标题。默认只列当前工作区，也可跨工作区查询并限制返回条数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:338-384"]}
{"unit_id":"tonyzdev__dsh-session-messaging#feature-2","repo":"tonyzdev/dsh-session-messaging","commit":"69a97309ab3462249bdd02802d700ed93d08c55f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「跨会话发消息」：向另一个顶层会话发送带来源说明的消息；运行中的会话可立即接收或排队，空闲或存储中的会话会被唤起。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-215","lib/index.js:128-151"]}
