{"unit_id":"tonyzdev__dsh-session-messaging#caveat-1","repo":"tonyzdev/dsh-session-messaging","commit":"69a97309ab3462249bdd02802d700ed93d08c55f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"会话列表、消息发送和新建会话只面向顶层会话；子 agent 不会显示这三个工具，需使用 DSH 自带的父子消息通道。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:92-100","lib/index.js:578-598"]}
{"unit_id":"tonyzdev__dsh-session-messaging#caveat-2","repo":"tonyzdev/dsh-session-messaging","commit":"69a97309ab3462249bdd02802d700ed93d08c55f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"发送工具的成功结果只表示收件箱接受了消息，不代表对方已处理；实现没有重试、去重或已读回执。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-215"]}
{"unit_id":"tonyzdev__dsh-session-messaging#caveat-3","repo":"tonyzdev/dsh-session-messaging","commit":"69a97309ab3462249bdd02802d700ed93d08c55f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"README 写明支持 DSH 0.2.0+，但 package.json 的 engines 限定版本低于 0.3.0；安装前应核对实际兼容范围。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:41","package.json:41-43"]}
